# Facty — environment files (secrets). NEVER commit real values.
#
# Two files, both gitignored:
#   ~/.facty/.env  — machine-local secrets. Keep the REAL keys here: the
#                    repo (with a project .env) is mounted into the
#                    gondolin VMs, and a guest must not read them — the
#                    VM's host-secret mechanism injects placeholders and
#                    the host proxy substitutes the real values into
#                    outbound requests.
#   ./.env         — project defaults (non-secret values only).
#
# Format: KEY=VALUE per line, `#` comments, optional quotes. The real
# environment always wins (a shell export is never overridden).
#
# Hoist into the VMs (the launching shell):
#   eval "$(./facty env --exports)"
#   make vm-up          # gondolin reads the keys host-side
#                        # (--host-secret KEY@host in gondolin-pi.sh)
#
# The keys Facty knows (add new ones here + in engine/dotenv.py):
#
# The Strom decider tier (the label sensor's adjudication tier) —
# Uprelic, EU/Paris. Delete test keys before anything gets pushed.
#UPRELIC_API_KEY=upr_...
#
# The LLM API for ephemeral gondolin-pi boots (the long-lived VM session
# holds it host-side via `make vm-up`). Never print, log, or commit it.
#MISTRAL_API_KEY=...
